]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Darke County record runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years. In 2025, August to September on the middle came in at 45% of normal. Grid 24181 had its driest year in 1963 at 62% of normal.</p>"}
